        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jun Ji-hyun, Gianna Jun, Wang Ji-hyun, Kwak Jae-yong, Cha Tae-hyun, Lee Min-ho\n- Products: My Sassy Girl, The Legend of the Blue Sea\n- Roles: The Girl\n- Topics: South Korean actresses, South Korean romantic comedy films, South Korean television series\n\nFacts:\n- Jun Ji-hyun was born as Wang Ji-hyun on 30 October 1981 and is also known as Gianna Jun.\n- Jun Ji-hyun is a South Korean actress.\n- My Sassy Girl is a 2001 South Korean romantic comedy film directed by Kwak Jae-yong and starring Jun Ji-hyun and Cha Tae-hyun.\n- Jun Ji-hyun rose to fame for playing The Girl in My Sassy Girl.\n- My Sassy Girl was one of the highest-grossing Korean comedies of all time.\n- The Legend of the Blue Sea is a 2016–2017 South Korean television series starring Jun Ji-hyun and Lee Min-ho.",
